OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks more control of town
OL,4,Acentre development
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent council is hoping for greater
OL,7,Fcontrol of the development of key town
OL,8,Fcentre buildings which can currently be
OL,9,Fconverted to residential use without
OL,10,Fplanning permission.
OL,12,FMaidstone Borough Council (MBC) is set
OL,13,Fto apply for an Article 4 Direction,
OL,14,Fwhich would remove the automatic
OL,15,Fdevelopment rights given to office
OL,16,Fbuildings of more than 1,500 sq m
OL,17,F(16,145 sq ft).
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
