OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks more control of town
OL,4,Acentre development
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvicta House, Medway Bridge House,
OL,7,FMeadow House, Kestrel House and
OL,8,FKnightrider House, and County Gate One
OL,9,Fand Two on Stacey's Street, have been
OL,10,Fidentified for proposed inclusion.
OL,12,FCouncillor Tony Harwood, cabinet member
OL,13,Ffor planning policy, said this would
OL,14,Fallow future changes to these buildings
OL,15,F"to be properly considered".
